  "releaseNotes": "- Updated Light Theme to use Light Blue Theme and renamed old Theme to Hybrid\n      - Also updated new Light Theme colors\n    - Split DataGridButton out of TabButton and changed to show only on selection or pointer over\n    - Toolbar/Image Buttons can now show Flyouts using the TaskInstance\n    - Toolbar/Image Buttons now show a Flyout for any errors\n    - Added Theming for TextControlBorderFocused and ComboBoxDropDownBorder\n    - Fixed removing extra UI items when deleting from DataView layer\n    - Fixed native theme loading not accounting for Brush opacity\n    - Fixed DataRepo Indices that use restricted characters in the GroupId\n    - Added Summary documentation for Extensions and ItemCollections",
